Subject: Welcome to UTMFW 8.0!

Highlights of this release are:
- SSLproxy 0.10.0, with HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 support, and ICAP subsystem
- icapsuricata 0.1.0
- Suricata 8.0.7
- c-icap 0.6.5
- E2Guardian 5.5.9
- OpenSSL 3.5.7
- libevent 2.1.13
- nghttp2 1.69.0
- nghttp3 1.18.0
- ngtcp2 1.25.0
- Variety of fixes and improvements

